    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener><fw place="top" type="letterhead">The Westminster Press <lb/>Witherspoon
                        Building, <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__747" type="place">Philadelphia</rs> 7,
                            <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__998" type="place">Pa.</rs></fw><fw
                        place="left" type="adressline"><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928"
                            type="person">Dr. Paul Tillich</rs>
                        <lb/>99 Claremont Ave. <lb/><rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place"
                            >New York</rs> 27, <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__865" type="place">N.
                            Y.</rs></fw><dateline><date when="1946-06-18">June 18,
                        1946</date>.</dateline><salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928"
                            type="person">Dr. Tillich</rs>:</salute>
                </opener>
                <p>I am delighted with your favorable reply to my request<note type="ea">Liegt nicht
                        vor.</note> for an advance review of <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__300"
                        type="person">Emil Brunner</rs>&apos;s <rs ref="#tillich__ASPVVH5A"
                        type="work">REVELATION AND REASON</rs> which we shall publish <date
                        when="1946-10-01">October 1st</date> ($ 4.50).</p>
                <p>A set of bound galleys has gone forward under separate cover and we shall, of
                    course, replace this with a copy of the finished book as soon as it is off
                    press.</p>
                <p>I&apos;ll appreciate it if you will forward your review to my personal attention
                    at which time the matter of an honorarium will be cleared promptly.</p>
                <closer><salute>Cordially,</salute><signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__791"
                            type="person">R. Clarke Hannaford</rs>
                        <lb/>Director <lb/>Merchandising
                    Division</signed><!--links, auf der anderen Seite von <q>Merchandising Division</q>: <q>RCHwm</q>-->
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
